@startuml
' Source: ../apollo-watchdog-architecture.drawio (page 11-recovery-sequence)
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans CJK KR
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor white
  ParticipantBorderColor #235D86
  ParticipantFontColor #172C43
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ArrowColor #235D86
  ArrowFontColor #172C43
  MessageAlign center
  ParticipantPadding 10
}
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor #94A3B8
scale max 790 width

participant "CL0 GIC" as p0
participant "SCP ISR" as p1
participant "SCP Framework" as p2
participant "RSE TF-M" as p3
participant "PPU / AP Reset" as p4

p0 -> p1 : 1. AP NS WS1 → INTID321 / FIQ
p1 -> p1 : 2. IRQ mask · recovery latch 설정
p1 -> p2 : 3. AP_WATCHDOG event 게시 · ISR 반환
p2 -> p4 : 4. 모든 AP core / cluster OFF 요청
p4 -> p2 : 5. OFF 상태 확인
p2 -> p3 : 6. BL2 reload 요청
p3 -> p2 : 7. 검증·재적재 성공 ACK
p2 -> p2 : 8. AP context · mailbox 정리
p2 -> p4 : 9. CPU0 ON 요청
p4 -> p4 : 10. Watchdog clear → AP reset / CPU release
p4 -> p2 : 11. CPU0 ON 통지
p2 -> p0 : 12. Pending clear · readback
p2 -> p2 : 13. Recovery latch 해제
p2 -> p0 : 14. IRQ enable · pending / recovery 재확인

@enduml
